    "description": "swissBOUNDARIES3D district boundaries constitute the administrative borders of the districts of the Swiss cantons. A district is an administrative subdivision positioned between canton and commune. The cantons of Geneva, Uri, Obwalden, Nidwalden, Glarus, Zug, Basel-Stadt and Appenzell Innerrhoden are not divided into districts. swissBOUNDARIES district boundaries is derived from the parent dataset swissBOUNDARIES3D.",
